Project modification notice: GE-Proton macOS Wine PoC
Modification date: 2026-10-13
Scope: Use exclusive present rectangles for macOS OpenGL backing sizes, fit top-level fullscreen client views to the host monitor and normalize the fullscreen state bit.
Original authors and per-file licenses remain applicable; see UPSTREAMS.md and configs/source-license-inventory.json.

--- a/dlls/winemac.drv/window.c
+++ b/dlls/winemac.drv/window.c
@@ -1176,7 +1176,7 @@
